---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '@/components/SectionHeading.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Tools"><section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-16 pb-24 sm:pt-24"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Tools & experiments" count={2}/><div class="border-line border-b py-6"><h2 class="font-display text-ink text-xl">Granny Translator · 是你奶奶！</h2><p class="text-ink-soft my-3" data-zh="使用「是、你、奶奶、！」四种符号进行文本编码与解码的趣味工具。">A playful four-symbol text encoder and decoder.</p><a class="text-signal font-mono text-sm" href="/translator/">Open tool →</a></div><div class="border-line border-b py-6"><h2 class="font-display text-ink text-xl">NetEase Album Exporter</h2><p class="text-ink-soft my-3" data-zh="将网易云音乐收藏专辑导出为结构化 CSV 数据的 Python 工具。">Export your saved NetEase Cloud Music albums to structured CSV data.</p><a class="text-signal font-mono text-sm" href="https://github.com/Kang-Zhaoyuan/NetEase_Album_Wall">View source ↗</a></div></section></BaseLayout>
